# Oteclan Landmark // Oteclan Levitator. The Landmark enters and scries 2 (the Mountain kept on top, the Island to the
# bottom). On turn three it crafts with an Ornithopter (Craft with artifact {2}{W}, CR 702.167a) and returns as Oteclan
# Levitator, a 1/4 white Golem artifact creature with flying (CR 712.8e). On turn seven it attacks beside Llanowar Elves
# and Embereth Shieldbreaker: "target attacking creature without flying gains flying until end of turn" may not target
# the Levitator (it has flying) nor Bot2's Shieldbreaker (not attacking), and gives Bot1's Shieldbreaker flying (the
# positive control, beside the Elves, which keep none), which it has no longer on turn nine.

